WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,540
Come on, what does the murderer look like?

2
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:09,620
It doesn't look big, about 1.7 meters

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:13,060
Not very strong, like someone crawling out of hell

4
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:15,750
I asked what exactly she looked like

5
00:00:15,750 --> 00:00:19,660
Tell me everything about your face, hair, and eyes.

6
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:21,980
The face is very white, as white as a ghost

7
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:24,820
Long hair and black eyes

8
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:30,070
I changed my mind

9
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,030
they will come out

10
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:35,270
Find food, water, and medicine

11
00:00:35,270 --> 00:00:37,950
As long as you come out, you will have a chance

12
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:41,680
From today on, all of you will take turns.

13
00:00:41,680 --> 00:00:44,200
Don't come close, just watch from the edge of the woods

14
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:47,470
Let me observe how many there are in them
